  NoteName: CrewmatesDoubt
  NoteHeader: Crewmates Diary
  NoteText: "Day 9\nThey\u2019ve started a church to worship that thing. holding
    rituals, sacrificing people..\nBut this \u201CDeity\u201D has never responded,
    never given them anything for it, it's onlytaken away.. their sanity, their lives..
    \n\nBut they keep going.. maybe because they've given up on escaping, or maybe
    its for a reason I can't understand..\n\nWhatever that THING is, it's taken their
    minds, and if they find out it hasn't taken mine too, they're going offer me
    to-\r"
